/Type /StructElem
/S /H2
/P 101 0 R
/T (Gives a complete overview of the account's active subscription. Shows plan details such as user limits and app limits, along with an option to upgrade. The Usage Details section tracks component-level usage, metrics, and custom alerts. A useful final step to confirm what the account currently includes and where action may be needed. A countdown banner shows exactly how many trial days remain, with an "Upgrade Now" button placed right alongside it. The Subscription tab focuses on plan limits, while the separate Usage Details tab drills into how much of each limit has actually been consumed. Reviewing this screen periodically helps avoid surprises, such as hitting a user or app limit in the middle of active development.)
/E (Gives a complete overview of the account's active subscription. Shows plan details such as user limits and app limits, along with an option to upgrade. The Usage Details section tracks component-level usage, metrics, and custom alerts. A useful final step to confirm what the account currently includes and where action may be needed. A countdown banner shows exactly how many trial days remain, with an "Upgrade Now" button placed right alongside it. The Subscription tab focuses on plan limits, while the separate Usage Details tab drills into how much of each limit has actually been consumed. Reviewing this screen periodically helps avoid surprises, such as hitting a user or app limit in the middle of active development.)
/Pg 23 0 R
/K [6]
