<<
/Title (Stores company-wide account details such as the logo, favicon, and contact information. Also includes super-admin details like registered email and phone number. Preferences here cover the organization's subdomain and time zone. This section defines the identity of the account itself, separate from any one application. The Edit link next to Contact Information lets an admin update the org name, address, or other details without leaving this screen. The logo and favicon uploaded here appear consistently across every application and portal built under the account. The organization namespace forms part of the account's unique web address, so it should be chosen carefully during setup.)
